examples.solution_text:
$7$ is not a perfect square, so $-\sqrt{7}$ is irrational. It is a real number.

$-\sqrt{7}=-2.6457513\ldots\approx-2.65$.

Its approximate position is between $-3$ and $-2.5$, closer to $-2.5$.

